{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-topological-open-site.md","title":"Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应","display":"Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-topological-open-site","aliases":["14-df-topological-open-site"],"display":"Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-small-site]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]","[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]"],"source_status":"由本对话附件中的拓扑层、站点层及层化定义推导；未读取附件以外原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-topological-open-site"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-topological-open-site</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8b8317e69a22cc8\" href=\"?note=e8b8317e69a22cc8\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos\">14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cbd8e35070d95035\" href=\"?note=cbd8e35070d95035\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits\">14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0db90275ed4c618a\" href=\"?note=0db90275ed4c618a\" title=\"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits\">14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"由本对话附件中的拓扑层、站点层及层化定义推导；未读取附件以外原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 的宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a>。前者的箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U,V)\">\\((U,V)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span> 时从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 指向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，因此下式的开集站点范畴取其反范畴。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\tau\">\\(U\\in\\tau\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}\\)</span> 的箭头集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 使用拓扑层定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})\\)</span> 使用站点层定义；两者均沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a> 的同一个满子范畴编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}\\)</span> 指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a> 的 Giraud 条件，不是另设的新谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)^{\\mathsf{op}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)^{\\mathsf{op}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\left\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(U)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(S,U)\\land\\bigcup_{a\\in S}\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(a)=U\\right\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\left\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(U)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(S,U)\\land\\bigcup_{a\\in S}\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(a)=U\\right\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\widehat{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}=\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\widehat{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}=\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})\\quad\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})\\quad\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})=\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})=\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项只补全附件已使用的两套层定义之间的接口。开集站点的箭头是原反向包含箭头在反范畴中的同一标签，源、靶一律由该范畴的投影读取；不把标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(U,V)\">\\((U,V)\\)</span> 误当成从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 指向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的站点箭头。</p>\n<p>最大筛的源开集之并为目标开集。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq U\">\\(V\\subseteq U\\)</span> 拉回覆盖筛，其源开集由原覆盖与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的交生成，仍覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>；覆盖局部性归结为开集并的结合律，故得到小站点。覆盖筛的相容族在交上相容，因而可用拓扑层条件粘合；反过来，一个开覆盖生成的筛上的相容族由给定截面的限制唯一确定，站点层条件给出原覆盖的唯一粘合。空覆盖也包含在这两个方向中。</p>\n<p>两次反范畴操作恢复原范畴六元组，所以预层范畴严格相等；相同的层对象谓词再给出相同的满子范畴，而不仅是抽象等价。初等拓扑斯性质因而由既有站点层定理得到。Giraud 条件也可在这个小站点呈现上直接检验：小极限逐点形成，小余极限由预层余极限后层化得到；预层中的普遍余极限、不交余积和有效等价关系由左正合层化传到层中；层化后的可表预层以开集集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为小指标生成层范畴。这说明后续对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 使用拓扑斯结构有明确的书内依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"e8b8317e69a22cc8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-category-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"cbd8e35070d95035","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"0db90275ed4c618a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-small-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-category]] 的宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$。$X\\in\\mathcal U$，$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$；$\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)$ 与 $\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]]。前者的箭头 $(U,V)$ 在 $V\\subseteq U$ 时从 $U$ 指向 $V$，因此下式的开集站点范畴取其反范畴。$U\\in\\tau$；$S$ 为 $\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}$ 的箭头集合，$F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-category]] 的宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$。$X\\in\\mathcal U$，$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$；$\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)$ 与 $\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]]。前者的箭头 $(U,V)$ 在 $V\\subseteq U$ 时从 $U$ 指向 $V$，因此下式的开集站点范畴取其反范畴。$U\\in\\tau$；$S$ 为 $\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}$ 的箭头集合，$F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下 $\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 使用拓扑层定义，$\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})$ 使用站点层定义；两者均沿用 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]] 的同一个满子范畴编码。$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}$ 指 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件，不是另设的新谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"以下 $\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 使用拓扑层定义，$\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})$ 使用站点层定义；两者均沿用 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]] 的同一个满子范畴编码。$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}$ 指 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件，不是另设的新谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"(U,V)","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)^{\\mathsf{op}}.","display":true},{"tex":"J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\left\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(U)\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(S,U)\\land\\bigcup_{a\\in S}\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}(a)=U\\right\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsSite}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau}),\\qquad\\widehat{\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau}}=\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathscr P_{X,\\tau})\\quad\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(F,X,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal O_{X,\\tau},J^{\\mathrm{opn}}_{X,\\tau})=\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)).","display":true},{"tex":"(U,V)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)","display":false}],"bytes":3870,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site|Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site]]"},{"id":"139c4bab72fb77d9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c1caa9c6c6dfe850","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-open-site|Definition — 拓扑空间的开集站点与层范畴对应]]"},{"id":"1cbcddc9f0a3bcfb","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(X,\\tau)$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小拓扑空间，$\\mathcal E=\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 的完整范畴，并采用 [[14-df-topological-open-site]] 的开集站点对应及拓扑斯结构。$\\mathbb Q\\subseteq\\mathbb R$ 取通常的有序数域及其包含，$\\mathbb R$ 取通常拓扑，$*$ 为固定单点标签。$Q_X=\\Delta_X\\mathbb Q$ 是 [[14-df-constant-sheaves]] 的有理数常层，故 $Q_X(V)$ 的元素是 $V\\to\\mathbb Q$ 的局部常值函数。其序子层 $O_Q$ 及包含 $o_Q:O_Q\\hookrightarrow Q_X\\times Q_X$ 由下式明确给出。$\\mathcal C_X=C_{\\mathbb R}$ 是 [[14-ex-continuous-function-sheaf]] 的连续实值函数层。固定逐点积、分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$ 与指数；$P_Q=\\Omega^{Q_X}$。$N_X,z_X,s_X$ 采用 [[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]]，并由 [[14-thm-natural-number-sheaf-recursion]] 满足自然数对象泛性质；$D_X=(N_X\\times N_X)\\times N_X$。有理商箭头 $q_X:D_X\\to Q_X$ 在 Assertion 给出。将 [[14-df-internal-dedekind-reals]] 的结构参数明确实例化为 $(N,z,s)=(N_X,z_X,s_X)$、$Q=Q_X$、$\\varpi=q_X$、$o=o_Q$，并固定其截子对象代表 $\\iota_{\\mathbb R}:\\mathcal R\\hookrightarrow P_Q\\times P_Q$；$\\mathcal R=\\mathbb R_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X)}$。"},{"id":"1dc2712cae6cd02a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续，$G$ 是 $(Y,\\nu)$ 上的层。茎公式的参数 $x$ 遍历 $X$；有限极限断言不要求 $X$ 非空。$I$ 为有限小范畴，$D:I\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)$ 为函子。选定极限锥 $(L,\\pi)$ 与 $(M,\\mu)$，满足 $\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(Y,\\nu)}(L,\\pi,D)$ 和 $\\mathrm{IsLimit}_{\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)}(M,\\mu,f^*\\circ D)$；存在性使用 [[14-df-topological-open-site]] 及 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。$\\kappa$ 在下式由全部锥分量方程唯一确定。茎使用 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]；$\\pi_2$ 为集合论有序对的第二投影，下式中的 $t(x)$ 属于 $E_{f,G}$。"},{"id":"c54d379516c87001","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 [[14-df-topological-open-site]]，$\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau)$ 为初等拓扑斯。采用 [[14-df-natural-number-sheaf]] 的 $\\mathbf{Sh}(X,\\tau),1_X,N_X,z_X,s_X$。$F$ 为 $X$ 上的层，$a\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(1_X,F)$、$h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,F)$ 是有源靶自然变换。$k\\in\\mathbb N$ 为外部自然数；每个开集 $V$ 上的集合箭头迭代满足 $h_V^{\\circ0}=1_{F(V)}$、$h_V^{\\circ(k+1)}=h_V\\circ h_V^{\\circ k}$。$U\\in\\tau$，$n\\in N_X(U)$，$t\\in F(U)$，$n^{-1}[\\{k\\}]$ 是开集。$\\operatorname{RecMatch}_U$、$u_U$ 与自然变换 $u$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","5036bba7ca747e71","e21364f5dcced9e7","e8b8317e69a22cc8","2e748a8b3caef6a6","cbd8e35070d95035","0db90275ed4c618a","28211adc1b0ce5bc","1601eff2507fda14"]}